          },
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your toes are adapted for gripping and climbing. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Combat Climber] feat as a bonus feat, and as long as you aren't wearing footwear, you can use the sticky pads on your feet to climb, leaving your hands free. Additionally, if you roll a success on an Athletics check to climb, you get a critical success instead.</p>"
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
