          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You can flare your neck frill and flex your dorsal spines, Demoralizing your foes. When you do, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Demoralize] loses the auditory trait and gains the visual trait, and you don't take a penalty when you attempt to Demoralize a creature that doesn't understand your language. You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Threatening Approach] action.</p>"
